From 3487ea208a55d67c04bfb85345c9bdd5980e9d4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:44:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] dt-bindings: clock: add Amlogic S6 clock controller IDs

Add the clock IDs of the Amlogic S6 PLL and peripherals clock
controllers and of the clocks the secure firmware exposes over SCMI.

They are taken verbatim from the Linux S6 clock bindings, so that the
device tree shared with Linux and the U-Boot S6 clock driver agree on
the numbering. They live in include/dt-bindings/ until the S6 clock
bindings reach dts/upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
---
